> waiting for dra.0.0.7.0 to start...
> is there a way to clear this config, so that it doesn't spend time looking
> for its drives ?
> It seems mlxctl doesn't allow this.

The DOS configuration utility can fix this.  Download it from the Mylex
web site; this is also the place to get a firmware upgrade.

Hope this helps,
Magnus



