XFree86-4.2.1. Certainly did not for me. Green artifacts is driver mga
for this card see:
http://news.gw.com/netbsd.ports.alpha/11317
The 164LX firmware accepts Nvidia cards, SRM has no problem with these
cards, they are very available(PCI version) and work very well on the
164LX box in 4.2.1. I have tested Riva TNT2, GeForce2, Geforce4 MX440
cards up to 64MB VRAM.'ogle' dvd player gives 17->22fps with synchronous
audio on my 164LX using the last Nvidia card.There are wscon 'issues'
already discussed on this list as well on the tech-x11 list. It is
interesting to note that the OpenBSD port of wscons to alpha has the
same problems:
http://news.gw.com/openbsd.alpha/367 (tail end)
Best -Mel



