> > The kernel switched to serial console at this point.
> > GENERIC kernel in 1.6 release does not support TC SFB
> > while it is supported in -current.
> 
> Why does it work for me? Do I have a different setup,
> or is it fixed in 1.6_STABLE too?

GENERIC in 1.6 supports TC 3000/600, but it does not support
any TC framebuffers though TCWSCONS kernel in 1.6 supports them.

TC fb supports are merged into GENERIC in -current since
MI zs8530 driver was fixed to handle quirks of zsc on TC IOASIC.
